  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova Media Information Integrity and Democracy Programme (M-MIIND)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is that the Moldovan population from all segments of society have access to independent information and make informed decisions on issues of public interest, and to enhance coordinated efforts to build resilience in the civil society to promote democratic values and media literacy, including gendered aspects.</narrative>
  </description>
